From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jim Martin <jimmartin@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 13:46:16 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] phy: qcom: edp: Forward video-ready notifications to the PHY
 version

Some eDP PHY settings differ between link training and active video, so
the PHY needs to know when the link has started carrying video. The PHY
framework's connect notification, phy_notify_connect(), is the existing
way for a consumer to report a change of link state to a PHY, and the
DisplayPort controller can call it once the main link is ready.

Add a connect op that hands the notification for port 0 to an optional
per-version video_ready callback. No PHY version implements the
callback yet, so nothing changes. Using the connect notification for
this is a proposal that needs agreement from the PHY maintainers.

Assisted-by: Opus 5.5
Signed-off-by: Jim Martin <jimmartin@gmail.com>
---
 drivers/phy/qualcomm/phy-qcom-edp.c | 12 ++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 12 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/phy/qualcomm/phy-qcom-edp.c b/drivers/phy/qualcomm/phy-qcom-edp.c
index 1414d8993cb..5fd0c563d8e 100644
--- a/drivers/phy/qualcomm/phy-qcom-edp.c
+++ b/drivers/phy/qualcomm/phy-qcom-edp.c
@@ -114,6 +114,7 @@ struct phy_ver_ops {
 				  unsigned long *pixel_freq);
 	void (*configure_lanes_after_pll)(const struct qcom_edp *edp);
 	int (*finish_power_on)(const struct qcom_edp *edp);
+	int (*video_ready)(const struct qcom_edp *edp);
 };
 
 struct qcom_edp_phy_cfg {
@@ -1658,6 +1659,16 @@ static int qcom_edp_phy_power_on(struct phy *phy)
 	return 0;
 }
 
+static int qcom_edp_phy_connect(struct phy *phy, int port)
+{
+	const struct qcom_edp *edp = phy_get_drvdata(phy);
+
+	if (port || !edp->cfg->ver_ops->video_ready)
+		return 0;
+
+	return edp->cfg->ver_ops->video_ready(edp);
+}
+
 static int qcom_edp_phy_power_off(struct phy *phy)
 {
 	const struct qcom_edp *edp = phy_get_drvdata(phy);
@@ -1694,6 +1705,7 @@ static const struct phy_ops qcom_edp_ops = {
 	.configure	= qcom_edp_phy_configure,
 	.power_on	= qcom_edp_phy_power_on,
 	.power_off	= qcom_edp_phy_power_off,
+	.connect	= qcom_edp_phy_connect,
 	.set_mode	= qcom_edp_phy_set_mode,
 	.exit		= qcom_edp_phy_exit,
 	.owner		= THIS_MODULE,
-- 
